          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Some of the stages have been clubbed together, for example, stages A and F in Fig. 10.7 have been kept under stage I. You will find four stages in the life cycle of a frog— the egg stage, which progresses to the embryo stage; the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "tadpole",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " stage, consisting of an early stage with a tail and no legs, and a late stage with hind legs; the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "froglet",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " stage, and the adult frog stage (Fig. 10.8)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.231,
            0.857,
